<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-McConnell half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-McConnell half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.03 vs 5.63</p>
<p>    Net					5.23 vs 4.05</p>
<p>    Sales				  166.41 vs 156.80</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   12.60 vs 9.73</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					2.78 vs 1.53</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs 0.05</p>
<p>NOTE: McConnell Dowell is a construction contractor and is 78 percent owned by Dominion Bridge Corp (formerly Cedar Group Inc).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
